{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "4c7ad69d3cbd4ebf75d39f963e6ba908606d9f02adc649d0040a038e84c1c963", "ja": "照らそう、雲の上から！", "zh": "照亮吧，从云层之上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c608a8f5fcc83eb95f47a2a3fddd44ccafbdaa253dc67b7e74d7c843b6722c0c", "ja": "翼がみんなを連れてきたのは『トッテモタカ\nイツリー』の展望デッキだった。最初は怖が\nっていた可奈も、高みから見上げた太陽に感\n銘を受け、あんな風にみんなをポカポカと照\nらすライブにしたいと決意する。", "zh": "翼带领大家前往的地点，\n是『高耸入云塔』的展望台。\n起初会害怕的可奈也在感受高处的太阳后，\n决心要营造出这样的感觉，\n打造一场照亮大家并带来暖意的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bfd6690f689459fc7715601bf5dfde7e034ce245d4ac58a4125fabcd192843d2", "ja": "（翼に連れられてやって来たのは、\n標高765メートルの高さを誇る新築の超高層タワー）", "zh": "（在翼的带领之下来到的，\n是以标高765公尺为傲，新盖的超高塔──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "21ca519268c870785327ba52349e74c07e9fd9c4457d843e3f6b20c0b9e8a5c6", "ja": "（『トッテモタカイツリー』の展望デッキだ）", "zh": "（『高耸入云塔』的展望台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "d871f45c3949ab60687b4c38bd4c71e89793fe25838775ca5580a57ed2784777", "ja": "ひゃ～……。\nどこまでも都会が続いてるよぉ……。", "zh": "哇……\n放眼望去是无边无际的都市哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5b9f8fcf90835a84b44947161f66c3852198edf51e19a690804104b0a632c79e", "ja": "ヒントは太陽……なるほど。確かにここは太陽に\nとっても近い場所だ。何か参考になるかもな。", "zh": "主题是太阳……原来如此。\n这里的确能更靠近太阳，或许能做点参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9f7c09148c5bd8a1b074eeee07fea9f8bbbbbd5f261d47a6af624340a9d32882", "ja": "えへへっ、そう思ったんでーす♪\nあっ、ほら、あんな遠くまで見えますよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我就是这么想的～♪\n啊，你们看，能眺望到那么远喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "bd56993a2417b49c14861bea67e52410090e328ebaf3a1526b3c58bab50c62b6", "ja": "あっ、あそこ、海の近くに見える四角い建物！\nあれって私達の劇場じゃない？", "zh": "啊，那边，那个靠近海边的四方型建筑物！\n那是不是我们的剧场呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "f224cbb25fbaf6dbb1d2c7e60fcf9084759757046fd00bf38634d33c94a7e7a5", "ja": "ホントだ！　ここから見るとちっちゃく感じるネ。\n劇場から、ワタシ達のこと見えるかナ？", "zh": "真的耶！从这里看过去感觉变好小呢。\n从剧场那边看得见我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "2dc9f6a51f57f11e0299bf2f26779e6a693b15681f28b593159d9cb83e8a781b", "ja": "手を振ったら気づいてくれるかも！\nほら、劇場の隣の川が下まで続いて……、ひっ！？", "zh": "挥挥手的话可能会注意到喔！\n你们看，剧场旁边的河流一路往下……噫！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "580ef383f53a375b41bfe7b561e1b3efb4c4ea62fd4ca8577222ca18e734360c", "ja": "ん？　可奈、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？可奈，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "6debeabe637b9d05072d2c82e9a6dedfb5c9e4703db8bcff55d36bc08b4be059", "ja": "下を向いて……\nもしかして、お腹が痛くなっちゃった？", "zh": "往下……\n该不会是觉得肚子痛了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "01b55671e3dc78a549f3aa77f049b1f2076a2b4c47bb9a5be01964bb11059035", "ja": "ち、違います美奈子さん！　ちょっと体の力が抜け\nちゃって……。だってここ、すっごく高いんですよっ！", "zh": "不、不是啦美奈子！只是有点全身无力……\n毕竟这里实在有够高嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cf1a86cec8182dcee233ac9190b194d1999e301b975722264c711e8b7902f58f", "ja": "ま、まあ、それが売りのタワーだから……\nそうか、可奈は足がすくんじゃったんだな。", "zh": "也、也是啦，这座塔的卖点就是高啊……\n这样啊，所以可奈紧张到脚软了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "3fb39427d85279ed45902911e362eb3a352817f1beddb2561d790de7874293c0", "ja": "でも、本当に高いですよね～。\n空に浮かんでるみたい！", "zh": "不过，真的很高呢～\n简直像浮在空中一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "4f667b373b4c013d0de0462a6a54cc008694c3f531d078408eea8188a4e85b06", "ja": "うう～っ……、翼ちゃんにだまされた～！\n楽しいところって言ってたのに～！", "zh": "呜呜……被小翼骗了啦～！\n明明说要去很开心的地方～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cc2713fa76fe3d27d7e2709d4479f9231d7c85627acdd755141480e20dec89f0", "ja": "え～？　だましてないよ～。\nだって高いところって楽しいでしょ？", "zh": "咦～？才没有骗你呢～\n待在高的地方不是很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "3ea956f2ceda9337ecedaef8e8ab3c2567a1209345e83faf0a3635543937fa29", "ja": "ウン♪　外を見てるだけで、\nすっごくエキサイティングだヨっ！", "zh": "嗯♪\n光是向外眺望，就觉得非常刺激唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "a71d222c4cc48d1c8cc0e7d32231f911fc191f3a24665604cf1bd3655abb49cb", "ja": "あたしも、最初はおっかなかったんだけども……\nここは頑丈みたいだから、きっと大丈夫だべさ！", "zh": "我一开始也觉得害怕……\n不过这里好像很坚固，一定没事的哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "70d5f55a54e38b3c2022bf294ea80a30bc367df6a4f275b38ac6389337370bc9", "ja": "そ、そうかなぁ、ひなたちゃん？\nうう、そうだといいなぁ～。", "zh": "真、真的吗，小日？\n呜呜，要是这样就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "b3920fc9ed9b6cfed017387df70fac5d7736fcc920f8b61ebcf9380ccb955922", "ja": "ふふっ、じゃあ、私が手を握っててあげる♪\nこれで一連托生だよ、可奈ちゃん！", "zh": "呵呵，那不然，我来握着你的手吧♪\n这样我们就是同生共死了喔，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb17e02618992ae8095be808daedc9c42d3f9445d27e0cc3a0b74903b8907600", "ja": "美奈子さん……\n嬉しいですけど、安心できません……。", "zh": "美奈子……\n虽然很开心，可是根本不能放心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "277aaa138899e03c9f464876d2a1da3de7b7101ca7ad5e8165f1653133283ded", "ja": "……よし、可奈、姿勢を正して、\nちゃんと前を向いてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "……这样吧，可奈，你先站好，\n然后试着直直往前看如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "d2f48da647a59bede11d26b373bcfd83edddeedd94a31a443236ef48de7a57b5", "ja": "ま、前、ですかぁ……？", "zh": "往、往前看吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "79286964215e0a93f7f1122e01a404a75e0a7932e79ddb9b0116990b8dea6b9e", "ja": "あっ、そうだよ可奈ちゃん、下ばっかり見ちゃうから\n怖いんじゃない？　上を見れば平気かも！", "zh": "啊，对呀可奈，你一直往下看才会觉得可怕吧？\n那看上面或许就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "f3cf3520a319193fed77da925f8a4f25799fa5d3915e098aba5936acc40ac1f5", "ja": "上って…………、わぁっ！", "zh": "你说上面…………哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "1d3b885e347bbee2a05f4c4ecbea9c3f91d040d7bfcbc4ee50a8a671bd5fc9a5", "ja": "すごい……！　雲がとっても近いよ！\n空もキレイ～！　なんか鳥になったみたい！", "zh": "好棒……！云朵好近喔！\n天空也好漂亮～！好像变成了一只鸟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2ba9bd0c56e48dc04bd9a51115f90a447f9fc823d11242a151a6f38155e7703", "ja": "だよね～。遠くの景色もキレイだし♪", "zh": "对吧～远方的景色也很漂亮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "1c81f6dfa8172c45aa1742a82553b8120f2f5260ebaf7263367fdb5203eb1d81", "ja": "ワーォ！　遠くの海の上にも、\n小さな船がたくさん浮かんでるヨー！", "zh": "哇喔！\n还有远方的海上，漂着很多艘小船唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "599ff72b49026810fa0718128ca8139947b4bd4e3f54ec29a39afbd3ff7d95dc", "ja": "ずーっと遠くのみんなまで……お日さまはこうやって、\n全部、見守ってくれてるんだねぇ。", "zh": "就连遥远的大家也一视同仁……\n太阳公公就像这样，持续守望着所有事物呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "a03f8b6121b2b7ba60767e301ef5d2ac138bfbe8b6cbeb5af7166fdaca49cb5b", "ja": "なるほど～。ふふっ、ひょっとしたら、お空の上の\n太陽さんの気分を、味わえちゃったのかもね♪", "zh": "原来如此～呵呵，那现在的我们，\n搞不好就体验到天上太阳的感觉了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "c9c6348012d343dc314a0a98ebf159463a09d1d3bc86d2db5e82b55e363c5ed6", "ja": "そっか！　翼ちゃん、ありがとー！\nおかげで私、太陽の気持ちがわかったかも！", "zh": "这样啊！小翼，谢谢你～！\n多亏有你的建议，我好像能体会太阳的感觉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "8f324ccb20720b5ff980b816bfb26985b2cb89a7bd3efe62eb3a78dec2f8cc55", "ja": "ウン！　ワタシ達も今度の公演で、ファンのみんなを\n照らして、ポカポカにしてあげようネ♪", "zh": "嗯！我们也要藉着这次的公演，\n照亮各位粉丝，让大家感觉暖洋洋的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "a2d0142467de0e8f109be115b8676bcec251018cbeaf08599dc4d2bda5441ba6", "ja": "みんなで一緒に頑張って、\n太陽みたいなライブにしよう♪", "zh": "大家一起加油，\n打造像太阳般的演唱会吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "973733b243a85d392051209f2f22b0aee9b9ca1b11d184c7b2118f1f6dfb68f6", "ja": "おお、みんなやる気になったみたいだな！\nもしかして翼、これが狙いだったのか？", "zh": "喔喔，看来大家都开始有干劲啰！\n翼，难道这就是你的目的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "52db3e7680e5fb2cdc13017ba4b880a7f776dce89789b0cf036ef582d98dc304", "ja": "え？　よくわかんないですけど……\nそれよりわたし、ここにいるの飽きてきちゃった！", "zh": "咦？我听不太懂你的意思……\n话说，我已经开始觉得这里待腻了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5eeea9247e6477a285229ef6b4638e2e8844d7c83fb8bf07e6b442fb05b4ee10", "ja": "早いな……。", "zh": "真快啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_02_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "79bc5b741c309493148070ef2c26229c0bddde9b25dd5d38c89f2393e77bb2a7", "ja": "下の階で、ショッピングとかプラネタリウム見たりとか\nできるんだって。みんな、早く行こう♪", "zh": "听说下面的楼层除了商场还有天象馆可以看喔。\n大家，我们快点走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
